#
# http://kr.eguide.lgappstv.com/manual/w22_mr6/global/Apps/w22_mr6_u17/u_enga/control.html
# Some buttons have additional functions on the actual remote accessed by long press, assumed to utilize BT signals.
# 9: Quick Help
# GUIDE: Channels
# 0: Quick Access
# ...: Displays additional buttons, long press configures SAP
# Mute: Accessibility
# Mic: Recommended contents, long press allows voice recognition
# Home: Last-used app
# Input: Home Dashboard
# Back: Closes menu
# Menu: All Settings
# Red: Record
#
# Shaking the actual remote or turning the wheel will create a pointer. The pointer will vanish if you click the arrow keys or not use it
#
